## Output

Return exactly one JSON object. Do not wrap in markdown fences.

{
  "analysis": "<interpretation of measured-window OTel evidence>",
  "bottlenecks": "<ranked services/spans/datastores with concrete latency values>",
  "suggestions": "<changes tied to observed bottlenecks>",
  "perf_metric": <float or null>,
  "perf_unit": "<unit string or null>"
}

IMPORTANT: Do not fabricate telemetry or infer a service breakdown from the
external benchmark latency alone.
